  "ingredients": [
    "0.75 cup white sugar",
    "0.5 cup unsalted butter, at room temperature",
    "2 large eggs",
    "1 cup all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "1 pinch salt",
    "12 medium Italian plums, halved and pitted",
    "1.5 tablespoons cinnamon sugar, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 10-inch springform pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0sH1jU7NcNaXMZLeMeoAFFICtww=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/283464-easy-plum-cake-VAT-005-step-01-4d61d26cfc974d6baa915ca196a37488.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/283464/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine sugar and butter in a large bowl and beat with an electric mixer until light and fluffy. Add eggs, 1 at a time, and beat well after each addition.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8tM1KQ86AFmE4ZwKkMVxGWh_UA4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/283464-easy-plum-cake-VAT-006-step-02-893a1fba709e4d50ae151ae61fddb2d0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/283464/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, baking powder, and salt in a separate bowl and sift on top of the butter mixture; mix to combine.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NNRrrtaxlpS7LrkplR99UNQPXuc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/283464-easy-plum-cake-VAT-007-step-03-02-f9f87ad174f64e49b7335af4e3ae3eaf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/283464/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer batter into the prepared springform pan and smooth out.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fFGJojME4HvVqAoUEMEWwgxX-GY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/283464-easy-plum-cake-VAT-008-step-04-220c1ede1bdc49ff9f64860d781137cc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/283464/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Set plums inside batter, cut-side up, and sprinkle evenly with cinnamon-sugar.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zeB5QdCIXMplIqZSJYmrwDpTnj4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/283464-easy-plum-cake-VAT-009-step-05-622d25f1c036464abbabaa5dd13b27ba.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/283464/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven on the lowest rack until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean, 40 to 50 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ftAKt1JwvWopVuXMlpsU38Lwqrw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/283464-easy-plum-cake-VAT-010-step-06-7ec7e5b1dd6c4f09b39fe9847af83b0c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/283464/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve warm or cool to room temperature.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ae8EZxlM71r_WUWjdtT_WNJPHEo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/283464easy-plum-cakeChristine4x3-a0447dc058a440c28cb6d20ae4132c9a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/283464/step_07.webp"
    }
